      "description": "<p><strong>Trigger</strong> The scrapborn is damaged by an attack dealing physical damage</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Effect</strong> The scrapborn directs the damage to one of the pieces of scrap attached to its body and gains resistance 15 against the triggering attack, but its AC is lowered by 2 for 24 hours. The scrapborn's AC cannot be reduced below 16 in this way.</p>\n<p>Effect: Sacrifice Armor</p>",
